              <li><strong>Public Buses:</strong> The lowest-cost option, but requiring significantly more time and transfers. Check the current route for your chosen site before departure.</li>
              <li><strong>Private Cars:</strong> Offers direct round-trip transport where the driver waits during your visit. See our <a href="/visiting-cu-chi-tunnels-by-private-car" class="text-amber-800 hover:underline font-semibold">Private Car Guide</a>.</li>
